    "classification": "champion",
    "type": "skulk",
    "difficulty": 16,
    "notes": "<h3>Champion | Skulk</h3>\n<p><em>A cloaked demon-creature with long limbs, seeping shadows.</em><br><strong>Motives &amp; Tactics:</strong> Make fear contagious, undermine resolve</p>\n<p><strong>Difficulty:</strong> 16 | <strong>Thresholds:</strong> 8/15 | <strong>HP:</strong> 6 | <strong>Stress:</strong> 5</p>\n<p><strong>ATK:</strong> +3 | Magic: Far | 2d6+1 physical</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Experience:</strong> Manipulation +3</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<p><strong>Despair - Passive</strong>: Deals double damage to PCs with 0 Hope.</p>\n<p><strong>Your Struggle Is Pointless - Action</strong>: Spend a Fear to affect all PCs within Far. All targets affected replace their Hope Die with a d8 until they roll a success with Hope.</p>\n<p><strong>Your Friends Will Fail You - Reaction</strong>: When a PC fails with Fear, you can <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to cause other PCs within Close to lose a Hope.</p>\n<p><strong>Momentum - Reaction</strong>: When the Demon makes a successful attack against a PC, you gain a Fear.</p>\n",
